  "content": "<h1>GD 解構器</h1><p><strong>摧毀物品並收集其資源。</strong></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgabriel-djalayer.gitbook.io%252fgdteam-wiki%252fprojects%252fmods%252fgd-uncrafter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-WIKI-2c2c2c?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=gitbook&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"IMG 徽章 - 維基\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gd-uncrafter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ON-CURSEFORGE-_?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;labelColor=2c2c2c&amp;color=e58e0e&amp;logoColor=e58e0e\" alt=\"IMG 徽章 - 從 Curseforge 下載\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fgd-uncrafter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ON-MODRINTH-_?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;labelColor=2c2c2c&amp;color=17b95a&amp;logoColor=17b95a\" alt=\"IMG 徽章 - 從 Modrinth 下載\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgabrieldja\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-SUPPORT-6d30fd?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=kofi&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"IMG 徽章 - 贊助\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgabrieldjalayer.wixsite.com%252fgabrieldja-gaming-yt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/MY_WEBSITE-245cf3?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"IMG 徽章 - GD 團隊\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/31958c_c58ad7f3c1a44e2a84c10a1e5e18607c~mv2.png\" alt=\"GD 解構器 - 橫幅\"></p><h2>📜 許可協議</h2><p>此資料包由 <strong>GabrielDja</strong> 創作。<br>\n📑 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgabriel-djalayer.gitbook.io%252fgdteam-wiki%252fguides%252flicenses%2523gd-uncrafter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">閱讀使用條款</a></p><h2>⭐ 使用方法</h2><p><strong>要摧毀物品，物品必須在您的主手上且未受損。</strong></p><ol>\n<li>拿起您想摧毀的物品。</li>\n<li>在聊天中輸入指令：<code>/trigger gd_uncrafter</code></li>\n<li>您的物品將被摧毀，並歸還製作所需的材料。</li>\n</ol><p><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgabriel-djalayer.gitbook.io%252fgdteam-wiki%252fprojects%252fmods%252fgd-uncrafter%252flist-of-supported-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">支援物品列表</a></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aTaHpj3.gif\" alt=\"GD 解構器 - 使用預覽\"></p><h2>🧩 資源包</h2><ul>\n<li>若下載模組版本，資源包已包含在內。</li>\n<li>若下載資料包版本，您需要另外下載資源包（可在與資料包相同的下載頁面取得）。</li>\n</ul><p><strong>建議使用資源包，因為它包含翻譯。</strong></p><h2>🌍 協助翻譯</h2><p>任何人都可以協助在 <a href=\"https://github.com/GabrielDja/GD-Uncrafter_Translations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 儲存庫</a> 中添加新語言。</p><h2>✨ 合作夥伴</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.rocketnode.com%252fgabrieldja\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/31958c_568565d2774047e188ebd98b83ef588c~mv2.png\" alt=\"合作夥伴 RocketNode 橫幅 - GabrielDja\"></a></p>",
